  <Lines>k__BackingField:
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 44ec2a6625f7a934dab5754819bfeb2e, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0358eca1d351f540a61dc689202b2b8, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Oui d\u2019accord."
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 44ec2a6625f7a934dab5754819bfeb2e, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 15a032d1f64921b49a6cec6c0a26887d, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Mon papa \xE9tait un super scientifique, je l\u2019aime beaucoup."
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 44ec2a6625f7a934dab5754819bfeb2e, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0358eca1d351f540a61dc689202b2b8, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - " J\u2019ai pass\xE9 60 ans avec lui, et maintenant il est mort, c\u2019est
      pour \xE7a que je suis devenu pirate."
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 44ec2a6625f7a934dab5754819bfeb2e, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3973df86522e4b743879172e3518e737, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "J\u2019essaie de trouver ma place, mais je suis un peu perdu sans lui, il
      me manque beaucoup."
